[{"title":"辛未清明感事","author":"张方平","text":"二十四年流水东，早为名误逐飞蓬。\n事随过鸟去无迹，愁似浊醪倾更浓。\n好是把花歌北榭，更休提剑哭西风。\n壮心郁郁身牢落，几见中林鹤发翁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":36243,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋夜禁直","author":"张方平","text":"朝著紫宸殿，直庐金马门。\n楞伽百八句，柱下五千言。\n何处求花藏，忘机即漆园。\n凉宵万籁寂，明月在前轩。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":36244,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再入禁林即事","author":"张方平","text":"重到金坡二十春，閒思出处一伤神。\n略行大地山川遍，再睹青天日月新。\n疏籁岂知谐律吕，散材无意入辕轮。\n何时却出都门去，静掩岩扉老此身。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":36245,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"两浙张兵部秋日牡丹诗次韵","author":"张方平","text":"霜天惨澹过重九，忽见幽芳发故丛。\n多爱清香对亭槛，不堪疏叶下梧桐。\n他年仙去空华表，此夜魂归尚汉宫。\n过眼须为无色观，返童疑有内丹功。\n写题更愧诗情浅，折带应宜醉脸红。\n须为重重张翠帟，可怜羸怯不禁风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":36246,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜意","author":"张方平","text":"群动已沈响，蛩吟时一声。\n露寒仙掌重，月午庾楼清。\n慷慨闻鸡舞，悲凉感笛情。\n几多尘役者，夙驾待钟行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":36247,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜虫","author":"张方平","text":"庭户閒扃月，草根寒带霜。\n时方感摇落，尔更助悲凉。\n漏版敲孤馆，灯青背曲房。\n向晨转哀急，几断旅人肠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":36248,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"风琴","author":"张方平","text":"露华月色澹轩庭，风过时同从籁鸣。\n谁挂机心在弦索，有弦宁更有全声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":36249,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寓兴","author":"张方平","text":"代舍悲弹铗，夷门默抱关。\n风云未时会，意气与身閒。\n剑为屠龙砺，弓须待虎弯。\n君看纬萧子，一旦探珠还。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":36250,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题葛驿李校书壁","author":"张方平","text":"八十不扶杖，看书夜每深。\n自言非服药，无事可关心。\n景为诗曾爱，花因醉尚簪。\n去城无一舍，路若隔飞沈。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":36251,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"蝉","author":"张方平","text":"红树依依古驿西，一声长是报秋期。\n新晴忽见横飞过，落晚最伤孤啸时。\n阴激英雄增感愤，潜催节物至萧衰。\n草根蟋蟀霜前雁，共与愁人染鬓丝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":36252,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"柳","author":"张方平","text":"翠眉含愁展新叶，长袖善舞拖旧条。\n黄莺初啭一何喜，红桃相映不胜娇。\n行人歇马近驿路，渔叟系舟临溪桥。\n斜风细雨与残照，不妨意气常飘飘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":36253,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"云","author":"张方平","text":"无端聚散千形出，本是轻清一气浮。\n终古光阴宁变坏，四时景象自迁流。\n宝华馥郁周三界，綵仗氤氲过十洲。\n远望非烟笼凤阙，近观如穗起龙湫。\n馀霞映日晴相照，素练横空晚未收。\n迥汉归槎遥泛泛，碧天孤鹤静悠悠。\n惊禽逸兽情无待，阵马风樯势莫留。\n泗水高歌增感慨，阳台残梦作閒愁。\n断虹落照江城暮，澹月疏星禁省秋。\n过岭时随樵叟去，傍溪聊伴野僧游。\n久阴泱漭重重积，忽霁飘零片片幽。\n待物方行嗟滞影，乘波妄触笑虚舟。\n仙家五色随鸾驾，海面千寻立蜃楼。\n雪意低浓伤旅馆，岁朝黄润喜农畴。\n初微触石才肤寸，曾不崇朝遍九州。\n生施功成让雷雨，无心却返旧山头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":36254,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"蝶","author":"张方平","text":"迟景融融暖气浮，中园曲密小庭幽。\n春风故引颠狂甚，芳树相容烂漫游。\n不分风流输楚女，懒将身世问庄周。\n有时潜见多情处，每遇王孙尽日留。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":36255,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"萤","author":"张方平","text":"土润正溽暑，幽庭熠耀飞。\n陈荄未全脱，生气一何微。\n风急光不灭，月明景共稀。\n蟏蛸与蟋蟀，时节伴依依。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":36256,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"归燕","author":"张方平","text":"社后日犹暖，雨前春尚寒。\n乘时众来易，无伴独留难。\n京洛柳花白，潇湘枫叶丹。\n堪伤季秋雀，风急海漫漫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":36257,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"柳","author":"张方平","text":"雨细池塘静，风斜院落深。\n蝶飞随乱絮，莺啭入浓阴。\n翠带堪纫佩，金丝可度针。\n愿依菩萨手，不上美人簪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":36258,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"七里濑","author":"张方平","text":"古有桐君住，汉时严子来。\n山横疑路尽，溪转若天开。\n尘世不相接，海潮从此回。\n维舟上层巘，恋恋白云堆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":36259,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"惊秋示三茅山人陈谷","author":"张方平","text":"晚来枕簟凉，杖屦望平野。\n疾风卷浮云，黄叶如雨下。\n奈此急景何，忽过如奔马。\n九丹功未成，幽恨将谁写。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":36260,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"清明连上巳","author":"张方平","text":"踏青原上饮，祓禊水边歌。\n佳节相连好，游人一倍多。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":36261,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"齐鲁道中望睢阳有念","author":"张方平","text":"重叠荒山满四围，征鞍系剑背斜晖。\n遥知梁国白云下，此际吾亲独倚扉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":36262,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"对酒","author":"张方平","text":"醉里翻身天地窄，愁来天地不容身。\n可怜泽畔行吟客，争似垆边高卧人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":36263,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赴益部途中","author":"张方平","text":"中台分虎节，全蜀领龟城。\n山色二千里，水声三十程。\n烟村深谷火，云栈半空铃。\n野馆无钟漏，猿吟晓日明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":36264,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"行次岐山","author":"张方平","text":"坤维五十郡，麾节忝师垣。\n缓辔犹秦甸，前驱已剑门。\n傥来增客气，重寄愧君恩。\n昨夜岐山梦，三归修竹园。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":36265,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过灞桥长安道上作","author":"张方平","text":"汉牒熟当披旧迹，灞桥今忽过征鞍。\n前朝宫展烟芜远，四望河山古木寒。\n自古功名应邂逅，大家岐路妄汍澜。\n兴亡甚费生灵血，只得高人梦幻看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":36266,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"青泥岭","author":"张方平","text":"斗峻凌霄出混茫，东西秦蜀此分疆。\n萦纡断涧千寻曲，回合危峦万叠苍。\n烟外孤村通鸟径，云间盘道绕羊肠。\n朝家方面非轻寄，何事徘徊望故乡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":36267,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"华州西溪","author":"张方平","text":"西溪殊近郭，少华更当轩。\n竹径通华表，松庭接绀园。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":36268,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过长安至岐山作","author":"张方平","text":"高原极望秦川阔，危栈横空蜀道长。\n多谢终南山色好，迢迢相送过岐阳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":36269,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过张真人洞","author":"张方平","text":"谷口巑岏狮子山，洞门高掩白云閒。\n自惭末裔无仙骨，名利途中鬓已斑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":36270,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"筹笔驿","author":"张方平","text":"本规一举定乾坤，遽见长星坠垒门。\n公在必无生仲达，师昭何业得中原。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":36271,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雨中登筹笔驿后怀古亭","author":"张方平","text":"山寒雨急晓冥冥，更蹑苍崖上驿亭。\n深秀林峦都不见，白云堆里乱峰青。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":36272,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"兴州长举县西二十里阁道立表曰飞石阁告往来者急度勿停予赴益部兴州将吏来迎皆至长举因访老吏飞石之状云昔尝有之亦飘风暴雨之时也予望山顶皆已垦耕而行人熟虚名至是皆驰过因成一绝","author":"张方平","text":"蜀道循山多险巇，行人独此策征羁。\n人情多为虚名怯，鹤唳风声走老氐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":36273,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"剑门关","author":"张方平","text":"地维绝脉摧鳌足，天垒横霄壮井舆。\n谁轧祸萌通鸟道，古为风土感鱼凫。\n壶中日月邻方外，海内山河入帝图。\n过此益知方面重，万兵开府一寒儒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":36274,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"华山云台观题希夷先生陈抟影堂","author":"张方平","text":"林壑云深接玉泉，松斋闭息辄经年。\n一无标致惟随俗，别有真机在指玄。\n诏板尝延清暑殿，诗筒时到华阳川。\n蜕形虽在张超谷，粟粒珠中自在天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":36275,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"相国杜公旧里钱唐有别野在华下既得谢留寓睢阳因家焉某近赴益部过三峰闻华人之望公舍而不还又顾吾乡之独幸国老处焉因道西人之意成长句四韵奉寄杜公","author":"张方平","text":"谋国有劳新史在，挂车无第旧乡遥。\n睢阳图记光耆彦，华下风烟遂寂寥。\n紫气尚劳关吏思，甘棠犹播陜民谣。\n莲花峰下仙人掌，高出云端若奉招。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":36276,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"上亭驿","author":"张方平","text":"雨中驻跸此闻铃，当日梨园写此声。\n忽忽悲心自多感，铃声何事怆人情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":36277,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"散水岩漱玉亭","author":"张方平","text":"高从云际落崔嵬，疑决银潢一派来。\n散漫难收珠网绽，琤瑽不断玉山摧。\n寻源谁到烟霞路，税驾聊倾沆瀣杯。\n向暮危亭上灯火，水精帘下烛房开。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":36278,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"泥溪驿","author":"张方平","text":"嘉陵江到水菰园，水势东回入阆川。\n前过剑门山路稳，免寻阁道上云巅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":36279,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杜鹃","author":"张方平","text":"蜀道寒轻水木清，峡中无复杜鹃声。\n归期正是春风暖，任向空山叫月明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":36280,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过嘉川驿","author":"张方平","text":"嘉陵江上嘉川峡，古木云萝千万峰。\n阁道缘山已经月，萦回未出画屏中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":36281,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"飞仙岭阁","author":"张方平","text":"苍崖老树云萝合，绝涧惊湍阁路高。\n羽驾飙轮殊惚恍，依程缓辔未为劳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":36282,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"乱石溪","author":"张方平","text":"乱石峥嵘散粟堆，飞湍奔泻万山开。\n轰空急若雷车过，振壑倾疑地轴摧。\n银汉势从天际落，云涛声破海门来。\n迸泉叠巘平生爱，欲转岩隈首重回。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":36283,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鱼关诗","author":"张方平","text":"中流石埭隐如磓，鼓鬣徜徉此复回。\n春水渐深沿泳快，为传尺素锦江来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":36284,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"青阳峡","author":"张方平","text":"奇峰叠巘无重数，横涧飞泉会一溪。\n老树藤萝从古长，寒空云霭与天迷。\n幽中应有神仙住，深处唯闻猿鸟啼。\n野性旧多山水癖，恨无心赏此相携。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":36285,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"药水岩诗","author":"张方平","text":"灵泉一派蜀江通，源出苍崖古洞中。\n乳滴云根苔臼满，药成仙灶石台空。\n琼缨珠络千岩霤，瑶瑟琅箫万壑风。\n杯勺已忻清病骨，刀圭敢望变衰容。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":36286,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宿龙门洞","author":"张方平","text":"路到葭萌古道边，层崖叠磴入苍烟。\n忽逢方丈在平地，何意中途过洞天。\n四面浓岚围碧嶂，半空急雨迸飞泉。\n一宵身世离尘境，却抚征骖懒下鞭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":36287,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"嶓冢","author":"张方平","text":"江汉朝宗入海长，尝蒙起浪卷轻航。\n金牛西路经嶓冢，却见微源此滥觞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":36288,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过汧河","author":"张方平","text":"岐南一舍过长汧，路近陈仓始入山。\n三十三程桥栈外，平川始下鹿头关。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":36289,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"采真堂赠郭诚思","author":"张方平","text":"香车晓驾九花虬，笳管声中到十洲。\n太一元君传密命，许君长住八琼楼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":36290,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闻蛩","author":"张方平","text":"惨澹霜风月色寒，愁人无寐坐閒轩。\n别听一部凄凉曲，几种秋虫咽草根。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":36291,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"探春","author":"张方平","text":"妙句江春入旧年，江梅长向腊中残。\n梁园地冷春来晚，试劈垂杨旧眼看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":36292,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"天寒","author":"张方平","text":"风裂幽窗水泽坚，寒郊空迥澹无烟。\n何因得向桃源去，景气长如二月天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":36293,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"慧聚寺东亭","author":"张方平","text":"野色秋光共泬寥，水村篱落晚烟交。\n拄筇回就下山路，行看斜阳隐树梢。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":36294,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"县斋怀京都","author":"张方平","text":"东南古县介江皋，西北神州倚斗杓。\n安得叶君传秘术，时飞双舄诣台朝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":36295,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"晓景","author":"张方平","text":"树带晓霜寒矗矗，山含宿霭远重重。\n谁家收得汾阳笔，八幅罗浮晦景浓。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":36296,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春郊","author":"张方平","text":"携樽纵步寻芳墅，聊藉芊芊手把红。\n行乐岂关閒客事，少侯长日占春风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":36297,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梦后","author":"张方平","text":"索索幽虫急晓风，玉绳西下露华浓。\n远钟惊觉窗灯暗，依旧江山一万重。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":36298,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书吴兴僧兴公院壁","author":"张方平","text":"我爱霅溪风景閒，年年鱼鸟伴湖山。\n利名人到心犹静，况是老僧长闭关。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":36299,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"耳鸣","author":"张方平","text":"一阳初独啸，两耳遂双鸣。\n寒谷疏钟远，霜空众籁清。\n千铃行险倦，万鼓战酣声。\n瀑落山头峻，涛翻海面平。\n风樯开大浪，晓角动严城。\n陇首悲凉意，苏门旷逸情。\n凤箫云外过，龙笛月中横。\n细转缫车急，微遥扤橹轻。\n衰残伤老态，驰徇厌时荣。\n处世希蒙叟，观身愧净名。\n神明思内守，豪荡悔平生。\n素问方家本，巢源导引精。\n早年曾有客，奇术可还婴。\n何日开金鼎，灵丹见八琼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":36300,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"蝉","author":"张方平","text":"密槐遮急雨，疏柳带斜阳。\n缑岭馀音远，苏门清啸长。\n附冠金翼薄，横鬓玉钗光。\n高洁自天禀，宁同蜂蝶狂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":36301,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题李先生隐居","author":"张方平","text":"金丹一指自崆峒，便控飞轮驾赤龙。\n况是曾居小有洞，更应不在易迁宫。\n紫文宝诀三元秘，皇象灵符二景通。\n却恨劳生闻道晚，九还未就已衰翁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":36302,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"芭蕉李都尉宅金渊阁分题得渊字","author":"张方平","text":"远寄江城外，新栽水阁前。\n虚心劳可尚，幻质定非坚。\n扇薄摇凉殿，杯深泛绮筵。\n忽疑鸾凤过，翠影落金渊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":36303,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赴新定过七里濑","author":"张方平","text":"舟过严陵濑，凉秋水木清。\n鼓旗知郭近，鱼鸟见人惊。\n云乱迷山色，滩长杂雨声。\n一毫名利事，搔首愧平生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":36304,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"仁宗皇帝挽辞三首 其一","author":"张方平","text":"享国承熙盛，斯民老太平。\n无私均覆载，大德共生成。\n阴骘无留迹，神功不可名。\n曰仁归祢庙，时夏绎清明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":36305,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"仁宗皇帝挽辞三首 其二","author":"张方平","text":"临御自初终，恭勤一日同。\n慈心夷夏等，诚意地天通。\n垂拱成文治，安和即武功。\n含生游寿域，四十二年中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":36306,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"仁宗皇帝挽辞三首 其三","author":"张方平","text":"谟训垂宽大，基图得显承。\n新宫开玉锁，旧册阅金滕。\n龙驾归虚极，鸾旗建大升。\n平生怀孝慕，游仗展三陵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":36307,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"英宗皇帝挽辞五首 其一","author":"张方平","text":"不问大横兆，天人心是真。\n讴歌早归舜，气志自如神。\n正合乾坤体，明开日月轮。\n孜孜朝昃意，克己为生民。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":36308,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"英宗皇帝挽辞五首 其二","author":"张方平","text":"旧学多闻富，咨周听德聪。\n乾元纯用九，丰日正宜中。\n治迹传英烈，神明溯阆风。\n平居修五事，洪范在潜宫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":36309,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"英宗皇帝挽辞五首 其三","author":"张方平","text":"八月初凉后，千年此去长。\n朝廷留事典，户牖想容光。\n濯景游霄极，乘云返帝乡。\n春秋大居正，天统付元良。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":36310,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"英宗皇帝挽辞五首 其四","author":"张方平","text":"遣奠宣哀册，严行按字图。\n桥山仙去远，渭水月游初。\n俭制遵遗训，方中列旧书。\n龙輴三十里，笳鼓节声徐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":36311,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}}]